@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "WhatsApp Growth for Local Businesses";
    Layout = "_MarketingLayout";
}

<div class="upliva-loader" id="platformLoader" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="upliva-loader-mark">U<span>+</span></div>
    <strong>UPLIVAAI</strong>
    <span>Business growth on WhatsApp</span>
</div>

<section class="upliva-slide upliva-hero" id="why">
    <div class="upliva-hero-glow upliva-glow-one"></div>
    <div class="upliva-hero-glow upliva-glow-two"></div>
    <div class="container upliva-hero-grid">
        <div class="upliva-hero-copy">
            <div class="upliva-eyebrow"><span></span> BUILT FOR THE AI ERA OF LOCAL BUSINESS</div>
            <h1>Stop losing customers in <em>everyday WhatsApp chats.</em></h1>
            <h2>Your customers are already there. <strong>Now make every message count.</strong></h2>
            <p class="upliva-hero-sub">UplivaAI gives your business a professional website, WhatsApp-led enquiries and AI-assisted productivity — without asking your customers to download another app.</p>
            <div class="upliva-hero-actions">
                <a class="upliva-btn upliva-btn-primary" href="/register">Get more leads on WhatsApp <span>↗</span></a>
                <a class="upliva-btn upliva-btn-secondary" href="#how-it-works">See how it works ↓</a>
            </div>
            <div class="upliva-trust-row">
                <span>✓ Website included</span>
                <span>✓ WhatsApp-first</span>
                <span>✓ No customer app</span>
                <span>✓ AI-ready</span>
                <span>✓ 100+ businesses</span>
                <span>✓ India · USA · Sri Lanka</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="upliva-hero-visual">
            <div class="upliva-video-shell">
                <div class="video-topline"><span class="live-dot"></span><span>20-second growth story</span><span class="video-sound">🔊 Music included</span></div>
                <video class="upliva-ad-video" controls playsinline preload="metadata" poster="@Url.Content("~/images/upliva/video-scene-1.png")">
                    <source src="@Url.Content("~/videos/uplivaai-20s-ad.mp4")" type="video/mp4" />
                    Your browser does not support video playback.
                </video>
                <div class="video-bottomline"><span>Missed chat → smart follow-up → new opportunity</span><span>Play with sound</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="upliva-floating-card lead-card"><span class="floating-label">NEW LEAD</span><strong>Customer asked for a price</strong><small>Reply while the interest is still hot.</small></div>
            <div class="upliva-growth-stamp">CHAT <b>→</b> LEAD <b>→</b> GROWTH</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="upliva-slide upliva-offer" id="how-it-works">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="upliva-section-heading center compact-heading">
            <span class="upliva-kicker">HOW IT WORKS</span>
            <h2>Simple for your customer. Smarter for your business.</h2>
            <p>Keep the conversation where your customers are comfortable — then give your team the tools to turn interest into action.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="upliva-storyline">
            <article><span>01</span><div class="story-icon">💬</div><h3>Customer messages</h3><p>A question, product request, price enquiry or offer response starts on WhatsApp.</p></article>
            <div class="story-arrow">→</div>
            <article><span>02</span><div class="story-icon">⚡</div><h3>Business responds smarter</h3><p>Share useful information, your website, offers and AI-assisted replies without changing the customer's habit.</p></article>
            <div class="story-arrow">→</div>
            <article><span>03</span><div class="story-icon">📈</div><h3>Interest becomes opportunity</h3><p>Capture enquiries, follow up clearly and keep more customers moving toward a purchase.</p></article>
        </div>

        <div class="upliva-business-problem">
            <div class="problem-copy"><span class="upliva-kicker">THE EVERYDAY PROBLEM</span><h3>“I'll reply later” is where many opportunities disappear.</h3><p>While you're serving customers, driving deliveries or running the shop, WhatsApp messages keep arriving. UplivaAI helps put a simple business process around those conversations.</p></div>
            <div class="problem-flow"><div><b>Customer asks</b><small>“Price?”</small></div><span>→</span><div><b>Message gets buried</b><small>Too many chats</small></div><span>→</span><div class="problem-final"><b>UplivaAI</b><small>Turn interest into a clearer next step</small></div></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="upliva-slide upliva-value" id="what-you-get">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="upliva-section-heading center compact-heading">
            <span class="upliva-kicker">WHAT YOU GET</span>
            <h2>One practical growth layer around your existing business.</h2>
            <p>No complicated customer app. No need to change how your customers communicate.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="upliva-value-grid">
            <article><div class="value-index">01</div><div class="value-icon">WA</div><h3>WhatsApp Lead Generation</h3><p>Make products, services, offers and enquiries easier to discover and easier to act on.</p></article>
            <article><div class="value-index">02</div><div class="value-icon">WEB</div><h3>Professional Website</h3><p>Give customers a trusted digital place for your business, products, services, offers and contact details.</p></article>
            <article><div class="value-index">03</div><div class="value-icon">AI</div><h3>AI-Assisted Productivity</h3><p>Reduce repetitive work with enquiry summaries, reply assistance and useful follow-up suggestions.</p></article>
            <article><div class="value-index">04</div><div class="value-icon">+</div><h3>Offers That Start Conversations</h3><p>Use deals and timely messages to give customers a reason to open WhatsApp and take the next step.</p></article>
        </div>

        <div class="upliva-proof-band">
            <div><strong>100+ businesses</strong><span>Supporting growing businesses across India, USA and Sri Lanka.</span></div>
            <div><strong>Built for local businesses</strong><span>Retail · Grocery · Hardware · Salon · Restaurant · Services</span></div>
            <div><strong>Ready for the AI era</strong><span>Start simple today and add smarter productivity as your business grows.</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="upliva-testimonials">
            <div class="testimonial-heading"><span class="upliva-kicker">CUSTOMER VOICES</span><h3>More conversations. Less chasing.</h3><p>Representative customer voices for the marketing prototype. Replace these with verified customer feedback and approved names as customers onboard.</p></div>
            <div class="testimonial-list">
                <article><div class="quote-mark">“</div><p>“Our customers already use WhatsApp. UplivaAI helps us turn those everyday questions into clearer sales opportunities.”</p><span>Illustrative · Retail business owner</span></article>
                <article><div class="quote-mark">“</div><p>“I do not want customers to download another app. I want them to message us, see what we offer and enquire quickly.”</p><span>Illustrative · Service business owner</span></article>
                <article><div class="quote-mark">“</div><p>“The website builds trust, WhatsApp starts the conversation and AI-assisted follow-up helps us stay productive.”</p><span>Illustrative · Local business owner</span></article>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="upliva-register-panel" id="pricing">
            <div><span class="upliva-kicker">START SIMPLE</span><h2>Make WhatsApp the front door to your business.</h2><p>Register your business. Our admin team reviews the details, configures your business page and publishes it when ready.</p><div class="price-line"><strong>Simple plans</strong><span>Designed for local businesses · Ask us for the current plan and onboarding details.</span></div></div>
            <div class="upliva-register-card"><span class="register-badge">GET STARTED</span><h3>Ready to turn chats into opportunities?</h3><div class="register-types"><span>Retail</span><span>Grocery</span><span>Hardware</span><span>Furniture</span><span>Salon</span><span>Restaurant</span><span>Resort</span><span>Services</span></div><a class="upliva-btn upliva-btn-primary full" href="/register">Register your business <span>↗</span></a><div class="register-login">Already registered? <a asp-route="UplivaLogin">Login here</a></div></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
